    text: "Duplicate check: searched all statuses for linked-file validation, orphaned paths, missing linked paths, and stale linked artifacts. Prior canonical items (for example pm-xz1p and pm-0v2m) are closed; this item tracks the current 2026-06-25 audit finding under pm-57vh."
  - created_at: "2026-06-25T05:07:39.548Z"
