    text: "Evidence: pm validate --check-files initially reported 146 stale linked paths (35 deleted, 111 moved) and 162 orphaned current source/test paths. Reconciled via pm files only: removed 80 deleted owner links, linked 162 current artifacts to validator owner candidates, migrated 972 moved owner links across 400 items, and split pm-hqka's malformed comma-separated path into four real file links. Re-running final file validation now."
